@startuml
title S54b SDIRK4 simulation architecture

class InitialValueProblem
class SimulationRequest
class SDIRK4 {
  + integrate(problem, request)
  - solve five sequential stages
}
interface DynamicalSystem
interface GuidingCenterJacobianSystem
class "integrate_fixed_grid" as FixedGrid
class IntegrationData
class IntegrationStep

InitialValueProblem --> DynamicalSystem
GuidingCenterJacobianSystem -up-|> DynamicalSystem
SDIRK4 --> InitialValueProblem
SDIRK4 --> SimulationRequest
SDIRK4 --> DynamicalSystem : vector_field
SDIRK4 ..> GuidingCenterJacobianSystem : analytic 2 x 2 blocks
SDIRK4 --> FixedGrid
SDIRK4 --> IntegrationStep : optional main-step observation
SDIRK4 --> IntegrationData

note right of SDIRK4
  S54b: 5 stages, order 4
  gamma = 1/4
  stiffly accurate
  not symmetric
  not symplectic
end note
@enduml
